# W7h, guest b (k2): starts a shared scene at @190 (TEST busy for 1200 ticks: every engine of the stage group not joinable); when it
# ends (about @210) its joinable STATE is the stage group's, a being silent, and c joins.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log b joined a
follow 40 until epoch>=@190
testhook busy 1200 until frames>=10
log b starts the scene
follow 40 until present=3 fail epoch>=@240
log b sees c while a is away
follow 40 until epoch>=@335 fail stage=stagml11
log b stayed
